      "en": "The Levites were counted from thirty years old and upward; and their number by their polls, man by man, was thirty-eight thousand.",
      "ko": "레위 사람은 삼십세 이상으로 계수하였으니 모든 남자의 명수가 삼만 팔천인데",
      "source_text_hash": "a64f1330ad3a8c6679348a599549fd264171b18e0e1df962a99b9f4b8b477c05",
      "translation_text_hash": "fd5b6fcdfc3bd383932c182443fee2733f6accf0e45aafce283502d2c1aaea4c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
