      "en": "four thousand were doorkeepers, and four thousand praised the LORD with the instruments which I made for giving praise.”",
      "ko": "사천은 문지기요 사천은 다윗의 찬송하기 위하여 지은 악기로 여호와를 찬송하는 자라",
      "source_text_hash": "5c21f7aa8d47ca9d3f0ed75613cc9fbc56c32065da5d63d0d168037335208519",
      "translation_text_hash": "5d4f97e3c2dcab0c79232afcc2d21ca745e718485ebc3d9fd44e0c9f64771cb2",
