      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 23,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "Jahath was the chief, and Zizah the second; but Jeush and Beriah didn’t have many sons; therefore they became a fathers’ house in one reckoning.",
      "ko": "그 족장은 야핫이요 그 다음은 시사며 여우스와 브리아는 아들이 많지 아니하므로 저희와 한 족속으로 계수되었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "312a08ac63c4f66c4c9d6f5ae69100a0fbbe209840d1c2e1f01c8937030d18bf",
      "translation_text_hash": "b9534923845a0a36a4d872a9795c3a6098bd9a0c0d590492ce30e21940af1932",
